{"id":"n43839-1-7","stage":5,"title":"농악 · 农乐","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n43839-1-7-1","ko":"농악 소리가 경쾌하네요.","zh":"农乐的声音真轻快啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"농악","meaning":"农乐","explanation":"농악：农乐。","readings":[{"term":"농악","audio":"/audio/f6f1bb02b592b3435fa3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43839","senseId":"1","lemma":"농악","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"농악","audio":"/audio/f6f1bb02b592b3435fa3.mp3"}},{"text":"소리가","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소리가","audio":"/audio/0c12216fc63402c5db52.mp3"}},{"text":"경쾌하네요.","meaning":"轻快","explanation":"경쾌하다：轻快；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"경쾌하다","audio":"/audio/0932c6972c735fc307a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26035","senseId":"1","lemma":"경쾌하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경쾌하네요","audio":"/audio/3d4c273fe09badb2d405.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f6f1bb02b592b343","term":"농악","zh":"农乐","audio":"/audio/f6f1bb02b592b3435fa3.mp3","entryId":"43839","definition":"韩国传统民俗音乐，主要在农村做集体劳动或过节时演奏。","pronunciation":["농악"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"声音，声，音，动静","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"物体震动发出的音波传入耳朵中产生的响声。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"0932c6972c735fc3","term":"경쾌하다","zh":"轻快","audio":"/audio/0932c6972c735fc307a8.mp3","entryId":"26035","definition":"行动、样子或心情等轻松愉快。","pronunciation":["경쾌하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1e02f1c9adfb717684e3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n43839-1-7-2","ko":"네. 힘들었던 농사일도 음악 소리에 잊히네요.","zh":"是啊，连辛苦的农活也被这音乐声给忘了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"힘들었던","meaning":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","explanation":"힘들다：累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘들었던","audio":"/audio/5bff41df3678b65a0b37.mp3"}},{"text":"농사일도","meaning":"农活儿，庄稼活儿","explanation":"농사일：农活儿，庄稼活儿；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"농사일","audio":"/audio/43b999d4e3663fb22f30.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28583","senseId":"1","lemma":"농사일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"농사일도","audio":"/audio/8a7d630332d82f662637.mp3"}},{"text":"음악","meaning":"音乐","explanation":"음악：音乐。","readings":[{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71115","senseId":"1","lemma":"음악","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}},{"text":"소리에","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소리에","audio":"/audio/01182838dbc2aef5b9e8.mp3"}},{"text":"잊히네요.","meaning":"被忘记","explanation":"잊히다：被忘记；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"잊히다","audio":"/audio/9291e999b361f3013dca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73860","senseId":"1","lemma":"잊히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잊히네요","audio":"/audio/814272e03706d5dcbc6f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"8e